    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "orchestrator_details",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 770,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "• Monitors all sessions — detects stuck (>5min stale), errored, idle states\n• Triggers gate evaluation when session goes Idle (agent signals 'done')\n• Injects feedback on gate failure → session resumes work automatically\n• Escalates to human after circuit breaker trips\n• Manages WIP limits — blocks new work when columns saturated",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },

    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "key_insight",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 920,
      "width": 1460,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "Key principle: Phase ≠ Runtime Status. AHP runtime (idle/running/input-needed/error) updates card facts,\nbut ONLY the gate engine can transition a card's SDLC phase. Cards never jump columns unpredictably.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    }
